    "['set protocols bgp group [parameter1]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'ipv6', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'ipv6', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': 'Here\\'s the translation of the Juniper BGP neighbor configuration to Huawei equivalent:\\n\\n##\\nipv6\\nbgp 100\\npeer 2001:db8:11::1 as-number 100\\npeer 2001:db8:11::1 enable\\n##\\n\\nNotes:\\n1. The Huawei configuration requires entering BGP configuration mode first (bgp 100)\\n2. The peer-as value (100) becomes the local AS number in Huawei\\n3. The neighbor address is configured similarly but with \"peer\" instead of \"neighbor\"\\n4. IPv6 BGP requires entering \"ipv6\" configuration mode first in Huawei\\n5. The \"enable\" command activates the peer session (implicit in Juniper)\\n6. The address family (inet6 unicast) is automatically enabled in Huawei when configuring under ipv6 mode', 'trans_template': 'ipv6'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'bgp 100', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'bgp 100', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': 'Here\\'s the translation of the Juniper BGP neighbor configuration to Huawei equivalent:\\n\\n##\\nipv6\\nbgp 100\\npeer 2001:db8:11::1 as-number 100\\npeer 2001:db8:11::1 enable\\n##\\n\\nNotes:\\n1. The Huawei configuration requires entering BGP configuration mode first (bgp 100)\\n2. The peer-as value (100) becomes the local AS number in Huawei\\n3. The neighbor address is configured similarly but with \"peer\" instead of \"neighbor\"\\n4. IPv6 BGP requires entering \"ipv6\" configuration mode first in Huawei\\n5. The \"enable\" command activates the peer session (implicit in Juniper)\\n6. The address family (inet6 unicast) is automatically enabled in Huawei when configuring under ipv6 mode', 'trans_template': 'bgp 100'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'peer 2001:db8:11::1 as-number 100', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'peer 2001:db8:11::1 as-number 100', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': 'Here\\'s the translation of the Juniper BGP neighbor configuration to Huaw