    "['import [parameter2]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'ipv6', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'ipv6', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the translation of the Juniper BGP neighbor configuration to Huawei equivalent:\\n\\n##\\nipv6\\nbgp 100\\npeer 2001:db8:11::1 as-number 100\\npeer 2001:db8:11::1 enable\\n##\\n\\nNotes:\\n1. Huawei requires explicit IPv6 enablement with the `ipv6` command\\n2. The BGP AS number is set in the BGP context (100 in this case)\\n3. The neighbor configuration is split into two commands in Huawei:\\n   - `peer [address] as-number` for AS specification\\n   - `peer [address] enable` to activate the session\\n4. The IPv6 unicast address family is enabled by default in Huawei when IPv6 is enabled\", 'trans_template': 'ipv6'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'bgp 100', 'parent_command': ['ipv6'], 'root': 'ipv6', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the translation of the Juniper BGP neighbor configuration to Huawei equivalent:\\n\\n##\\nipv6\\nbgp 100\\npeer 2001:db8:11::1 as-number 100\\npeer 2001:db8:11::1 enable\\n##\\n\\nNotes:\\n1. Huawei requires explicit IPv6 enablement with the `ipv6` command\\n2. The BGP AS number is set in the BGP context (100 in this case)\\n3. The neighbor configuration is split into two commands in Huawei:\\n   - `peer [address] as-number` for AS specification\\n   - `peer [address] enable` to activate the session\\n4. The IPv6 unicast address family is enabled by default in Huawei when IPv6 is enabled\", 'trans_template': 'bgp 100'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'peer 2001:db8:11::1 as-number 100', 'parent_command': ['ipv6'], 'root': 'ipv6', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the translation of the Juniper BGP neighbor configuration to Huawei equivalent:\\n\\n##\\nipv6\\nbgp 100\\npeer 2001:db8:11::1 as-number 100\\npeer 2001:db8:11::1 enable\\n##\\n\\nNotes:\\n1. Huawei requires explicit IPv6 enablement with the `ipv6` command\\n2. The BGP AS number is set in the BGP context (100 in this case)\\n3. The neighbor configuration is split into two commands in Huawei:\\n   - `peer [address] as-number` for AS specification\\n   - `peer [address] enable` to activate the session\\n4. The IPv6 unicast address family is enabled by default in Huawei when IPv6 is enabled\", 'trans_template': 'peer 2001:db8:11::1 as-number 100'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'peer 2001:db8:11::1 enable', 'parent_command': ['ipv6'], 'root': 'ipv6', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the translation of the Juniper BGP neighbor configuration to Huawei equivalent:\\n\\n##\\nipv6\\nbgp 100\\npeer 2001:db8:11::1 as-number 100\\npeer 2001:db8:11::1 enable\\n##\\n\\nNotes:\\n1. Huawei requires explicit IPv6 enablement with the `ipv6` command\\n2. The BGP AS number is set in the BGP context (100 in this case)\\n3. The neighbor configuration is split into two commands in Huawei:\\n   - `peer [address] as-number` for AS specification\\n   - `peer [address] enable` to activate the session\\n4. The IPv6 unicast address family is enabled by default in Huawei when IPv6 is enabled\", 'trans_template': 'peer 2001:db8:11::1 enable'}]]": 1,
